    "time_unit": "Julian centuries (Cy) for rates; hours/days/years for periods",
    "mass_unit": "kilograms (kg)",
    "rate_definition": "Each element X is propagated as X(t) = X0 + Xdot * T, where T = (t - 2451545.0) / 36525 is the number of Julian centuries past J2000 (TDB).",
